      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just that i'm tired though. it's like i'm already gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person, i just see a machine that exists to take care of things. if i wasn't here, everything would just keep spinning, but maybe it would be quieter? maybe people wouldn't have to deal with how heavy and broken i am all the time. it just feels like a cage i can't break out of.",
