    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no version of the future where this stops. every time i think there's a way out, the responsibilities just pile back up. it's like i'm just waiting for a blow to land. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be for everyone if i just... wasn't a burden anymore. if i could just find some peace and stop struggling so hard. do you think anyone actually finds peace when things are this heavy?",
